        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>复数三角形与虚数运算练习题</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(#fdfdfd 0px, #fdfdfd 27px, #e8eef5 28px);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .question-block {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .qtext {\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .answer-circle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #1a3fd6;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    color: #1a3fd6;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .options {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .options span {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 24%;\n  }\n  .hand-blue {\n    color: #1a3fd6;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .hand-red {\n    color: #d31414;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .side-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -30px;\n    top: 40px;\n    color: #1a3fd6;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    transform: rotate(90deg);\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  }\n  .solution-area {\n    margin: 6px 0 20px 40px;\n  }\n  hr.divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n  }\n  .diagram-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    margin: 4px 40px 4px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 130px;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .diagram-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    width: 100%;\n    left: 0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #888;\n  }\n  .red-box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #d31414;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n  }\n  .boxed-line {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d31414;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Question 1 -->\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div class=\"qtext\">\n      A，B分别是复数$z_1$，$z_2$在复平面内对应的点，O是原点，若$|z_1+z_2|=|z_1-z_2|$，则三角形AOB一\n      定是（<span class=\"answer-circle\">B</span>）.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. 等腰三角形</span><span>B. 直角三角形</span><span>C. 等边三角形</span><span>D. 等腰直角三角形</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-note\">21世纪教育网</div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"hand-blue\" style=\"max-width: 320px; margin-left: 40px;\">\n        由复数的几何意义得，<br>\n        OA，OB表示$z_1$，$z_2$<br>\n        ∵ $|z_1+z_2|=|z_1-z_2|$<br>\n        ∴ 以OA，OB为邻边的[?]四边形的对角线相等<br>\n        ∴ 该平行四边形为矩形<br>\n        ∴ OAB为直角三角形\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"diagram-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:200px;height:150px;\">\n          [Diagram: 平面几何图，含点 A、B、O，红色对角线交叉形成\"矩形/菱形\"标注]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <!-- Question 2 -->\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div class=\"qtext\">\n      已知i为虚数单位，则 $i+i^2+i^3+\\cdots+i^{2019}$ 等于（<span class=\"answer-circle\">D</span>）.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. i</span><span>B. 1</span><span>C. $-i$</span><span>D. $-1$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"solution-area hand-blue\">\n      $i+i^2+i^3+\\cdots+i^{2019}$<br>\n      $=i+i^2+i^3+\\cdots+i^{2016}+i^{2017}+i^{2018}+i^{2019}$<br>\n      <span class=\"boxed-line hand-red\">$i^{2016}+i^{2017}+i^{2018}+i^{2019}=0$</span><br>\n      <span class=\"hand-red\">循环为4，循环内部和为0</span><br>\n      ∴ 原式$=i+i^2+i^3$<br>\n      $=-1$\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <!-- Question 3 -->\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div class=\"qtext\">\n      若复数z满足$(3-4i)z=|4+3i|$，则z的虚部为（<span class=\"answer-circle\">B</span>）.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. $-4$</span><span>B. $-\\dfrac{4}{5}$</span><span>C. $-4i$</span><span>D. $-\\dfrac{4}{5}i$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"solution-area hand-blue\">\n      ∵ $(3-4i)z=|4+3i|$<br>\n      ∴ $z=\\dfrac{|4+3i|}{3-4i}=\\dfrac{5}{3-4i}$\n      <span class=\"hand-red\">&nbsp;&nbsp;→先表示出z</span><br>\n      $=\\dfrac{5(3+4i)}{(3-4i)(3+4i)}$\n      <span class=\"hand-red\">&nbsp;&nbsp;→分母，乃分同乘3-4i的共轭把复数</span><br>\n      $=\\dfrac{3}{5}+\\dfrac{4}{5}i$<br><br>\n      ∴ $\\bar{z}=\\dfrac{3}{5}-$<span class=\"red-box\">$\\dfrac{4}{5}$</span>$i$\n      <span class=\"hand-red\">&nbsp;&nbsp;虚部</span><br>\n      ∴ z的虚部为$-\\dfrac{4}{5}$\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
